# V1 READ-ONLY RULE

The existing project outside V2 is the original/submitted MSc project.

Treat V1 as reference material only.

NEVER:
- edit V1 files
- delete V1 files
- rename V1 files
- refactor V1
- overwrite V1 results
- change V1 configuration
- change V1 dependencies
- modify V1 notebooks
- move V1 files unless explicitly instructed

All new development must take place inside V2.

V1 may be inspected and referenced to understand:
- research context
- previous architecture
- previous implementation
- dataset
- evaluation approach
- previous results
- known limitations

Before modifying any file, verify that it belongs to V2.

If a task appears to require changing V1, STOP and ask for explicit confirmation.